    "description": "Objective\n\nDistinguish Sign-Ups a Rep logged by hand from ones created by future proof-ingestion automation.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Field on Sign_Up__c tracking whether the Lead -> Sign-Up conversion was manual (Rep clicked Log Sign Up) or automated\n\n* Set by the Log Sign Up flow for the manual path\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Manual path stamps the field correctly\n\n* Field is reportable\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nForward-looking: the automated value has no producer until proof ingestion is built (Phase 2+). Build the field NOW so history is clean from day one — cheap now, expensive to backfill later.\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~2h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 25.",
